hadiths[113]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1091","Yahya related to me from Malik from Muhammad ibn Yahya ibn Habban from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1092","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1093","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abd ar-Rahman ibn al-Qasim that his father said about the word of Allah"
"1094","Malik related to me from Abdullah ibn al-Fadl from Nafi ibn Jubayr ibn Mutim from Abdullah ibn Abbas that the Messenger of Allah"
"1095","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Said ibn al-Musayyab had said that Umar ibn al-Khattab said"
"1096","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that al-Qasim ibn Muhammad and Salim ibn Abdullah were marrying off their daughters and they did not consult them. Malik said"
"1097","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that al-Qasim ibn Muhammad and Salim ibn Abdullah and Sulayman ibn Yasar said about the virgin given by her father in marriage without her permission"
"1098","Yahya related to me from Malik from Malik from Abu Hazim ibn Dinar from Sahl ibn Sad as-Saidi that a woman came to the Messenger of Allah"
"1099","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Said ibn al-Musayyab had said that Umar ibn al-Khattab said"
"1100","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that the daughter of Ubaydullah ibn Umar whose mother was the daughter of Zayd ibn al- Khattab"
"1101","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz during his khalifate"
"1102","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Said ibn al-Musayyab that 'Umar ibn al-Khattab decided about the woman who was married by a man and the marriage had been consummated"
"1103","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Zayd ibn Thabit said"
"1104","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Said ibn al-Musayyab said"
"1105","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr ibn Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Hazm from Abd al-Malik ibn Abi Bakr ibn Abd ar- Rahman ibn al-Harith ibn Hisham al-Makhzumi from his father that when the Messenger of Allah"
"1106","Yahya related to me from Malik from Humayd at-Tawil that Anas ibn Malik said"
"1107","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Said ibn al-Musayyab was asked about a woman who made a stipulation on her husband not to take her away from her town. Said ibn al-Musayyab said"
"1108","Yahya related to me from Malik from al-Miswar ibn Rifaa al- Quradhi from az-Zubayr ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn az-Zubayr that Rifaa ibn Simwal divorced his wife"
"1109","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from al-Qasim ibn Muhammad that A'isha"
"1110","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that when asked whether it was permissible for a man to return to his wife if he had divorced her irrevocably and then another man had married her after him and died before consummating the marriage"
"1111","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1112","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Said ibn al-Musayyab said"
"1114","Yahya related to me from Malik from more than one source that when Abdullah ibn Masud was in Kufa"
"1115","Malik said that a man who had committed fornication with a woman and the hadd-punishment had been applied to him for it"
"1116","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abd ar-Rahman ibn al-Qasim from his father from Abd ar-Rahman and Mujamma the sons of Yazid ibn Jariya al-Ansari from Khansa bint Khidam al-Ansariya that her father gave her in marriage and she had been previously married. She disapproved of that"
"1117","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zubayr al-Makki that a case was brought to Umar about a marriage which had only been witnessed by one man and one woman . He said"
"1118","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Said ibn al- Musayyab and from Sulayman ibn Yasar that Tulayha al-Asadiya was the wife of Rushayd ath-Thaqafi. He divorced her"
"1119","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Abdullah ibn Abbas and Abdullah ibn Umar were asked about a man who had a free woman as a wife and then wanted to marry a slave-girl. They disapproved that he should combine the two of them"
"1120","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Said ibn al-Musayyab said"
"1121","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Abu Abd ar- Rahman that Zayd ibn Thabit said that if a man divorced his slave-girl three times and then bought her"
"1122","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Said ibn al-Musayyab and Sulayman ibn Yasar were asked whether"
"1123","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had asked Ibn Shihab about a man who had a slave-girl as a wife"
"1124","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ibn Utba ibn Masud from his father that Umar ibn al- Khattab was asked about a woman and her daughter who were in the possession of the right hand"
"1125","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Qabisa ibn Dhu'ayb that a man asked Uthman ibn Affan whether one could have intercourse with two sisters who one owned. Uthman said"
"1126","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that az-Zubayr ibn al-Awwam said the like of that. Malik said that if a man had sexual relations with a female slave that he owned"
"1127","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Umar ibn al-Khattab gave his son a slave-girl and said"
"1128","Yahya related to me from Malik that Abd arRahman ibn al-Mujabbir said that Salim ibn Abdullah gave his son a slave-girl and said"
"1129","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Abu Nahshal ibn al-Aswad said to al-Qasim ibn Muhammad"
"1130","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibrahim ibn Abi Abla from Abd al-Malik ibn Marwan that he gave a slave-girl to a friend of his"
"1131","Malik said"
"1132","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab"
"1133","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Abdullah and Hasan"
"1134","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Urwa ibn az- Zubayr that Khawla ibn Hakim came to Umar ibn al-Khattab and said"
"1135","Yahya related to me from Malik that he heard Rabia ibn Abd ar- Rahman say that a slave could marry four women. Malik said"
"1136","Malik related to me from Ibn Shihab that he had heard that in the time of the Messenger of Allah"
"1137","Yahya related to me from Malik that Ibn Shihab said"
"1138","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Umm Hakim bint al-Harith ibn Hisham who was the wife of Ikrima ibn Abi Jahl became muslim on the day of the conquest of Makka"
"1139","Yahya related to me from Malik from Humayd at-Tawil from Anas ibn Malik that Abd ar-Rahman ibn Awf came to the Messenger of Allah"
"1140","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yahya ibn Said said"
"1141","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1142","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibr. Shihab from al-Araj that Abu Hurayra said"
"1143","Yahya related to me from Malik that Ishaq ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Talha heard Anas ibn Malik say that a certain tailor invited the Messenger of Allah"
"1144","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam that the Messenger of Allah"
"1145","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zubayr al-Makki that somebody asked a man for his sister in marriage and the man mentioned that she had committed fornication. Umar ibn al-Khattab heard about it and he beat the man or almost beat him"
"1146","Yahya related to me from Malik from Rabia ibn Abi Abd ar-Rahman that al-Qasim ibn Muhammad and Urwa ibn az-Zubayr said that a man who had four wives and then divorced one of them irrevocably"
"1147","Yahya related to me from Malik from Rabia ibn Abd ar-Rahman that al-Qasim ibn Muhammad and Urwa ibn az-Zubayr gave the same judgement to al-Walid ibn Abd al-Malik in the year of his arrival in Madina except that al-Qasim ibn Muhammad said that he divorced his wife on various occasions. (i.e. not at one time)"
"1148","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Said ibn al-Musayyab said"
"1149","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Rafi ibn Khadij married the daughter of Muhammad ibn Maslama al-Ansari. She was with him until she grew older"
"1150","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that a man said to Abdullah ibn Abbas"
"1151","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that a man came to Abdullah ibn Masud and said"
"1152","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Abu Bakr ibn Hazm thatUmar ibn Abd al-Aziz had asked him what people said about the 'irrevocable' divorce"
"1153","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Marwan ibn al-Hakam decided that if someone made three pronouncements of divorce"
"1154","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Umar ibn al-Khattab had heard in a letter from Iraq that a man said to his wife"
"1155","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Ali ibn Abi Talib used to say that if a man said to his wife"
"1156","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar said that statements like ""I cut myself off from you"""
"1157","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from al-Qasim ibn Muhammad that a certain man had taken a slave-girl belonging to somebody else as a wife. He said to her people"
"1158","Yahya related to me from Malik that he heard Ibn Shihab say that if a man said to his wife"
"1159","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that a man came to Abdullah ibn Umar"
"1160","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar said"
"1161","Yahya related to me from Malik from Said ibn Sulayman ibn Zayd ibn Thabit that Kharija ibn Zayd ibn Thabit told him that he was sitting with Zayd ibn Thabit when Muhammad ibn Abi Atiq came to him with his eyes brimming with tears. Zayd asked him what the matter was. He said"
"1162","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abd ar-Rahman ibn al-Qasim from his father that a man of Thaqif gave his wife command over herself"
"1163","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abd ar-Rahman ibn al-Qasim from his father that A'isha"
"1164","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abd ar-Rahman ibn al-Qasim from his father that A'isha"
"1165","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Abdullah ibn Umar and Abu Hurayra were asked about a man who gave his wife power over herself"
"1166","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Said ibn al-Musayyab said"
"1167","Yahya related to me from Malik from Jafar ibn Muhammad from his father that Ali ibn Abi Talib said"
"1168","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar said"
"1169","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Said al-Musayyab and Abu Bakr ibn Abd ar-Rahman said about a man who made a vow to abstain from intercourse with his wife"
"1170","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Marwan ibn al-Hakam decided about a man who had made a vow to abstain from intercourse with his wife"
"1172","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had asked Ibn Shihab about the ila of the slave. He said that it was like the ila of the free man"
"1173","Yahya related to me from Malik from Said ibn Amr ibn Sulaym az- Zuraqi that he asked al-Qasim ibn Muhammad about a man who made divorce conditional on his marrying a woman i.e. if he married her he would automatically divorce her. Al-Qasim ibn Muhammad said"
"1174","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that a man asked al-Qasim ibn Muhammad and Sulayman ibn Yasar about a man who pronounced dhihar from his wife before he had married her. They said"
"1175","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa that his father said that a man who pronounced a dhihar from his four wives in one statement"
"1177","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa that he heard a man ask Urwa ibn az-Zubayr about a man who said to his wife"
"1178","ahya related to me from Malik that he asked Ibn Shihab about the dhihar of a slave. He said"
"1179","Yahya related to me from Malik from Rabia ibn Abi Abd ar-Rahman from al-Qasim ibn Muhammad that A'isha umm al-muminin"
"1180","ahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar said that a female slave who was the wife of a slave and then was set free"
"1181","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Urwa ibn az- Zubayr that a mawla of the tribe of Banu Adi called Zabra told him that she had been the wife of a slave when she was a slave-girl. Then she was set free and she sent a message to Hafsa"
"1182","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Said ibn al-Musayyab said that if a man married a woman"
"1183","Malik said that if a slave-girl"
"1184","Yahya related. to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Amra bint Abd ar-Rahman told him from Habiba bint Sahl al-Ansari that she had been the wife of Thabit ibn Qays ibn Shammas. The Messenger of Allah"
"1185","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from a mawla of Safiyya bint Abi Ubayd that she gave all that she possessed to her husband as compensation for her divorce from him"
"1186","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Rubayyi bint Muawwidh ibn Afra came with her paternal uncle to Abdullah ibn Umar and told him that she had divorced her husband for a compensation in the time of Uthman ibn Affan"
"1187","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Said ibn al-Musayyab and Sulayman ibn Yasar and Ibn Shihab all said that a woman who divorced for a compensation had the same idda as a divorced woman - three periods. Malik said that a woman who ransomed herself could not return to her husband except by a new marriage. If someone married her and then separated from her before he had intercourse with her"
"1188","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Sahl ibn Sad as-Saidi told him that Uwaymir al-Ajlani came to Asim ibn Adi al- Ansari and said to him"
"1189","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafic from Abdullah ibn Umar that a man cursed his wife in the time of the Messenger of Allah"
"1190","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that `Urwa ibn az-Zubayr said that if the child of the woman against whom li`an had been pronounced or the child of fornication"
"1192","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Muhammad ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Thawban that Muhammad ibn Iyas ibn al-Bukayr said"
"1193","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Bukayr ibn Abdullah al-Ashajj from an-Numan ibn Abi Ayyash al Ansari from Ata ibn Yasar that a man came and asked Abdullah ibn Amr ibn al-As about a man who divorced his wife three times before he had had intercourse with her Ata said"
"1194","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Bukayr ibn Abdullah al-Ashajj informed him that Muawiya ibn Abi Ayyash al- Ansari told him that he was sitting with Abdullah ibn az-Zubayr and Asim ibn Umar ibn al-Khattab when Muhammad ibn Iyas ibn al-Bukayr came up to them and said"
"1195","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Talha ibn Abdullah ibn Awf said"
"1196","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn al-Fadl from al- Araj that Uthman ibn Affan made the wives of ibn Mukmil inherit from him"
"1197","Yahya related to me from Malik that he heard Rabia ibn Abi Abd ar-Rahman say"
"1198","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Muhammad ibn Yahya ibn Habban said"
"1199","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard Ibn Shihab say"
"1200","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Abd ar- Rahman ibn Awf divorced his wife"
"1201","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar said"
"1202","Yahya related to me from Malik that Ibn Shihab said"
"1204","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from Sulayman ibn Yasar that Nufay"
"1205","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Said ibn al- Musayyab that Nufay"
"1206","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdu Rabbih ibn Said from Muhammad ibn Ibrahim ibn al-Harith at-Taymi that Nufay"
"1207","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar said"
"1208","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar said"